tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3048438Z   ok   the discount does not depend on the end temperature the solver picks
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3048544Z   ok   free gains that cover the whole loss leave no hold demand
