tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3220493Z   ok   no evidence, or nothing to deliver, is None — never a write
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3220569Z   ok   the map rides its store round trip
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3220645Z   ok   a corrupt map loads what survives
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3220740Z   ok   transient divergence during a ramp is not a fault
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3220863Z   ok   three CONSECUTIVE divergent ticks trip the watchdog, exactly then
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3220976Z   ok   a missing report is a stale input, never divergence evidence
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221075Z   ok   an observed cycle folds (frequency, kW) into the map
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221155Z   ok   immersion intervals never teach the map
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221263Z   ok   reverse-cycle cooling never teaches the frequency map
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221373Z   ok   a pinned stale power reading never teaches the frequency map
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221518Z   ok   external heat still folds: the map is a compressor curve, not a house learner
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221613Z   ok   a defrost interval never teaches the frequency map
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221706Z   ok   null control: a non-defrost interval still folds
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3221849Z   ok   an offline, faulted or cooling pump's interval never teaches the frequency map
