tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3222562Z   ok   a second write inside five minutes is rate-limited away
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3222671Z   ok   re-commanding the same value is deduplicated, not re-sent
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3222851Z   ok   observe mode never writes, however good the map
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3223002Z   ok   a map with no evidence writes nothing — None is never a frequency
