tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3265662Z -- v4.0.5 — DHW conservation: a cold tank cannot pour hot water
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3265754Z   ok   the booked draw never exceeds the nominal demand
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3265863Z   ok   every step balances: in == out + losses + storage delta
