tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3327405Z   ok   a garbage store loads as empty rather than raising ({'factors': 'bad', 'duty': 3})
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3327539Z   ok   a window whose clock cannot be compared measures nothing, and is refused
