tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3397429Z   ok   no metric is exempt from the ratchet: the two retired categories are gone
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3397560Z   ok   improvement_rows names cross_seam_edges like any other row when it falls
