tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3547289Z   ok   reload onto another switch mid-boost: the new switch ON, the old one OFF, in the same cycle
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3547634Z   ok   renamed switch: the old record is kept through the grace, then dropped with a persistent repair naming it, and nothing is written blind
tests / fast (3.14)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-27T13:35:22.3547796Z   ok   …and the drop is in the store, so a restart does not resurrect the record
